,"tongjian_id":"a3d17769-db0e-11ef-9f89-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"常伯，侍中也。納言，尚書也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"常伯，侍中也。纳言，尚书也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"a3d1776c-db0e-11ef-8b2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a3d17770-db0e-11ef-96b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a3d17771-db0e-11ef-8d06-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「曜」下有「不從」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「曜」下有「不从」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a3d1776f-db0e-11ef-bd03-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"a3d1776e-db0e-11ef-8472-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_reference","source_end_index":16,"source_start_index":13,"source_text":"事見後","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a3d8709c-db0e-11ef-89a2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"苟曜","people_name_jianti_auto":"苟曜","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a3d17773-db0e-11ef-8c1d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"后秦","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a3d17774-db0e-11ef-b23b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"苟曜後持兩端，爲後秦所殺，事見後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苟曜后持两端，为后秦所杀，事见后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"a3d17772-db0e-11ef-b8e6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄭縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑县","resolved_place_entity_id":513,"start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"a3d1777f-db0e-11ef-bc66-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"胡氏曰：郑县之广乡原也]。","context_before":"广乡原[在州西。","source_end_index":31,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d7b8df60-758c-57de-8220-0e9e2d726f8c","source_start_index":8,"source_text":"晋太元十五年，冯翊人郭质起兵广乡，移檄讨姚苌。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"9秋，七月，馮翊人郭質起兵於廣鄕以應秦，移檄三輔曰：「姚萇凶虐，毒被神人。吾屬世蒙先帝堯、舜之仁，非常伯、納言之子，卽卿校、牧守之孫也。與其含恥而存，孰若蹈道而死。」於是三輔壁壘皆應之；獨鄭縣人苟曜聚衆數千附於後秦。秦以質爲馮翊太守。後秦以曜爲豫州刺史。","content_fanyi":"秋，七月，冯翊人郭质在广乡起兵响应并归附前秦，向三辅百姓发布檄文说：“姚苌凶恶残暴，祸害遍及天神和民众。我们世代蒙受先帝苻坚像尧、舜那样的仁德，即使不是侍中、尚书一类官员的儿子，就是卿、校、牧、守一类地方官员的孙子。与其忍受屈辱活着，不如为道义而死。”于是三辅一带的壁垒都响应他的号召；唯独郑县人苟曜聚集数千部众归附后秦。前秦任命郭质为冯翊太守。后秦任命苟曜为豫州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"9秋，七月，冯翊人郭质起兵于广鄕以应秦，移檄三辅曰：「姚苌凶虐，毒被神人。吾属世蒙先帝尧、舜之仁，非常伯、纳言之子，即卿校、牧守之孙也。与其含耻而存，孰若蹈道而死。」于是三辅壁垒皆应之；独郑县人苟曜聚众数千附于后秦。秦以质为冯翊太守。后秦以曜为豫州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9544,"number":9,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七 (晉紀二十九) / 烈宗孝武皇帝中之下 / 十五年 / 第 10 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a3d17760-db0e-11ef-abd1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":390},"tongjian_id":"a3d17760-db0e-11ef-abd1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"鄭縣"},"message":"success","success":true}